tract|land-area|NOUN|large area of land|A large area of land considered as one piece.|vùng đất; khoảng đất rộng|The council set aside a tract of land for a public park.|Hội đồng dành riêng một vùng đất để làm công viên công cộng.|Countable; a tract of land is the usual construction. Anatomical tract and short written tract are different senses.|-
welfare|well-being|NOUN|health and good living conditions|The health, comfort, and good living conditions of a person or group.|phúc lợi; sự an lành; đời sống tốt đẹp|The organisation puts the welfare of its workers first.|Tổ chức đặt phúc lợi của người lao động lên hàng đầu.|Uncountable; welfare of someone concerns their well-being, not necessarily a government payment.|0
welfare|social-support|NOUN|public support for people in need|Support provided through public systems for people who need help with basic living needs.|trợ cấp xã hội; hỗ trợ an sinh|The office explains how residents can apply for welfare.|Văn phòng giải thích cách cư dân có thể xin hỗ trợ an sinh.|Usually uncountable; welfare benefits names forms of support. Eligibility depends on the particular system.|1
drastic|far-reaching|ADJECTIVE|having a large or extreme effect|Having a very large or extreme effect on a situation.|mạnh mẽ; quyết liệt; sâu rộng|The shortage forced a drastic reduction in opening hours.|Tình trạng thiếu hụt buộc phải cắt giảm mạnh giờ mở cửa.|Usually before a noun such as change or reduction; drastic need not involve violence.|-
frequent|often-occurring|ADJECTIVE|happening often|Happening often or at repeated short intervals.|thường xuyên; hay xảy ra|Frequent delays made the morning journey difficult.|Những lần chậm trễ thường xuyên khiến chuyến đi buổi sáng khó khăn.|Adjective before a noun or after a linking verb; frequently is the related adverb.|0
irrigate|supply-crop-water|VERB|supply land with water for growing plants|To supply water to land or crops so that plants can grow.|tưới tiêu; tưới nước cho đất trồng|Farmers irrigated the dry fields using a narrow channel.|Nông dân tưới các cánh đồng khô bằng một con mương hẹp.|Transitive irrigate land or crops; the land is the object, not the person receiving water.|-
